### Login (JWT for the protected /api/** calls below)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jwt.gate@eh8s.local",
  "password": "eh8s-dev-pass1"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Treasury without Bearer must be 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/treasury?walletPubkey=7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC

### Treasury for a non-owner wallet must be 403
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/treasury?walletPubkey=YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Treasury for the owner wallet: PDA DxGjk32d..., ATA 9ptwWxWj..., live DevNet balance, inflows, withdrawals
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/treasury?walletPubkey=7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Build withdraw_treasury for 1 USDC (owner signs next in the wallet)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/treasury/withdraw/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "amountUsdc": 1.00
}

### Build more than the treasury holds must be 409
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/treasury/withdraw/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "amountUsdc": 1000000
}

### Forged confirm: the init_treasury signature (upgrade authority, not withdraw) must be 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/treasury/withdraw/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "amountUsdc": 1.00,
  "txSignature": "57HQdQXw5KakRBWEqa9kSStuEZant4dqNdTMX4toHLJQUW9QdpfWZYTgiDioNNSgppkRndG8Lzx4j7p2UnEZrjoi"
}
